sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer (PWA)
    participant N as Next.js server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant SSE as SSE fan-out
    participant RZ as Razorpay
    participant SMS as SMS
    participant K as Kitchen Panel
    participant R as Rider Android

    C->>N: GET /r/[slug] (QR scan)
    N->>DB: SELECT restaurant + menu + offers
    N-->>C: SSR HTML

    C->>N: POST /api/auth/otp
    N->>SMS: send 6-digit code
    C->>N: signIn with phone+code
    N->>DB: upsert User · grant signup bonus

    C->>N: POST /api/orders
    N->>DB: BEGIN TX
    N->>DB: apply happy-hour · resolve offers · hold bonus
    N->>DB: INSERT Order + OrderItems
    N->>DB: COMMIT
    alt UPI / Card
        N->>RZ: create intent
        C->>RZ: pay
        RZ->>N: webhook (signed)
    else COD
        N-->>C: status RECEIVED
    end
    N->>SSE: branch:X:orders new
    SSE-->>K: order:new

    K->>N: transition ACCEPTED → PREPARING → READY
    N->>SSE: order:Y status

    R->>N: claim order
    N->>DB: RiderAssignment + payout (override-aware)
    loop GPS pings
        R->>N: POST /api/rider/ping
        N->>SSE: order:Y gps
    end

    R->>N: verify-otp
    N->>DB: DELIVERED · commit bonus · refresh challenges
    SSE-->>C: feedback CTA

    C->>N: POST /api/customer/orders/:id/feedback
    N->>DB: INSERT OrderFeedback (windowEndsAt = +48h)
